3. Accessing using packed structures: 

itoh32_u(*dst, *src)

 is expanded into:

*((uint32_t *)&(*dst)) = (((uint32_s *)&(*src)))->v

The resulting code:

Alpha:

        itoh32_u(*dst, *src);
