	Before or after new kernel ?

	A way more reliable "patch" is to DISABLE  vfork()  by replacing
	current  alpha_vfork()  with following code:

int alpha_vfork(struct switch_stack * swstack)
{
        return do_fork(SIGCHLD, rdusp(),
                        (struct pt_regs *) (swstack+1));
}

	This is at arch/alpha/kernel/process.c


