'man mke2fs' is recommended; especially about option -m.  With ext2fs
this number by default is around 5% (not very precise as this depends on
a disk layout a bit) so add this overhead to your sum.  You can specify
some other reserve.  This is nothing new in 6.0.  This was always like
that.

